    <briefdescription>
<para>Orphaned link resolution scenario for process linker. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> Links that reference deleted or non-existent models/instances <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Links persist but marked as stale; detected at read-time <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> <computeroutput>RETRIEVAL_INCIDENT</computeroutput> on read <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Link is not corrupted or deleted</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Staleness is detected at read-time</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Diagnostic message explains link is stale</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Operator can manually repair or delete </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
